## 1. s1 is blocked: parse_frame has no signature in the plan
Options:
- a) answer: <text> — relayed to the implementer
- b) re-plan — a fresh planner rewrites the stages not yet committed
- c) stop — the run halts, the board stays for a resume
Answer: <1: a <text> | b | c>
